            ],
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "note_base": "Go out after making dumplings at 15:00 (包完饺子后出门逛); 2.5 hours to explore before dinner",
            "note_local": "包完饺子后15:00出发；有2.5小时探索时间然后回家吃饭",
            "notes_base": "CITY WALK AFTER DUMPLINGS (15:00-17:30) - Go out to explore Bazhong city after making dumplings together (包完饺子后出门逛，15:00出发). Take girlfriend for extended city walk in Bazhong. Explore downtown area with 2.5 hours. Options: visit Baren Square (巴人广场), Binhe Road Riverside Walk (滨河路亲水步道), stroll around Bazhong downtown area, or visit Wangwang Mountain Sports Park (望王山运动公园) if time permits. Light shopping, cafes, local exploration. Return home by 17:30 for New Year's Eve dinner preparation.",
